      ## Traits

      ***Illumination.*** The beetle sheds ***Bright Light*** in a 10-foot radius and ***Dim Light*** for an additional 10 feet.

      ## Actions

      ***Bite.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=To Hit [Bite]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* 1 Fire damage.

